OL,3,GNEWSATeenager denies planning to kill
OL,4,Aboy in fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager accused of stabbing a
OL,7,F14-year-old to death in a fight
OL,8,Farranged on social media has denied
OL,9,Fplanning to kill him.
OL,11,FThe 16-year-old, who cannot be named
OL,12,Fbecause of his age, denies murdering
OL,13,FChristopher McBurnie on 29 May last
OL,14,Fyear and says he acted in self-defence.
OL,16,FGiving evidence at his trial, he said
OL,17,Fthreats to kill Christopher in a group
OL,18,Fchat were "bravado" and "empty
OL,19,Fthreats".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
