OL,3,GNEWSATeenager denies planning to kill
OL,4,Aboy in fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FCross-examining, prosecutor David
OL,7,FTemkin KC said the defendant had told
OL,8,FChristopher he would come out of his
OL,9,Fhouse and kill him, adding: "That was
OL,10,Fexactly what you intended to do."
